## Privacy and evidence boundary

```text
professional role claim != verified employment
same display name != same person
public business contact channel != personal contact detail
public professional profile != source-automation authorization
public/consented community context != private-life profile
service relevance != cyber need or opportunity
contact relevance != outreach authorization
```

## Delivered

- dedicated `professional_context` bounded context;
- source-qualified professional-person references with no automatic same-name merge;
- explicit lawful-basis reference, processing purpose, review timestamp and retention deadline;
- temporal role/team/employment evidence with correction, supersession, dispute, retraction and historical/stale states;
- direct reporting-line evidence with no self-reference and no transitive hierarchy inference;
- business-only contact channels: business email, business email pattern, organization switchboard, contact form and public professional-profile reference;
- public/community context accepted only through explicitly approved API, administrator-installed integration, authorized export or reviewed import semantics;
