## Evidence boundary

This is the **SEE** slice. It proves browser-visible/deployable physical Crooked Checkpoint materialization and stable refresh identity. It does not yet prove WASD movement, collision authority during movement, durable position recovery, Runtime persistence of a newly accepted materialization ref, Pell interaction/context custody, West Woods transfer, or same-map Tactical Activation.

